  ('eb087ce7-8f6a-424c-883d-d5e1aaffb4b9', 'en', 'KI/KI', 'dutch dj and record producer', 'Kiki Wesselo, known professionally as KI/KI, is a Dutch DJ and record producer. Her music and DJ sets are associated with techno, acid techno, trance and 1990s-inspired rave sounds.', array[]::text[], 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/KI%2FKI'),
