  ('0bf03f33-6510-41df-8bbd-2d5d2bac466a', 'en', 'Brand New', 'american rock band', 'Brand New is an American rock band formed in 2000 from Long Island, New York. Consisting of lead vocalist and rhythm guitarist Jesse Lacey, lead guitarist Vincent Accardi, bassist Garrett Tierney and drummer Brian Lane, the band earned critical recognition as one of the most influential emo bands, and was acclaimed for their musical development and artistic innovation compared to other groups in the scene from which they originated.', array[]::text[], 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brand_New_(band)'),
