  ('1343103b-dc8e-4d90-8e07-fe3cc60a2889', 'en', 'Placebo', 'british alternative rock band', 'Placebo are a British alternative rock band, formed in London in 1994 by vocalist-guitarist Brian Molko and bassist-guitarist Stefan Olsdal, who have remained the two constant members, with three full-time drummers throughout the band''s existence.', array[]::text[], 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Placebo_(band)'),
