  ('aeafbf61-a0db-4e37-a7d0-4126ca60843f', 'en', 'Soul II Soul', 'british musical collective', 'Soul II Soul are a British musical collective formed in London in 1988. They are best known for their two major hits: 1989''s UK number five and US number eleven "Keep On Movin''", and its follow-up, the UK number one and US number four "Back to Life".', array[]::text[], 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soul_II_Soul'),
