  ('f18379a9-0889-4aa3-ba94-ac81e3c36ea6', 'en', 'Pitbull', 'american rapper (born 1981)', 'Armando Christian Pérez, known professionally as Pitbull, is an American rapper, singer, songwriter, and actor. He began his career in the early 2000s as a reggaeton, Latin hip-hop, and crunk performer, and signed with TVT Records to release his debut album, M.', array[]::text[], 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pitbull_(rapper)'),
