  ('930d7ea6-630c-49dc-bf3f-e65c966855a7', 'en', 'Black Country, New Road', 'english rock band', 'Black Country, New Road are an English rock band formed in Cambridge in 2018. Originally founded by Tyler Hyde, Lewis Evans, Georgia Ellery, May Kershaw, Charlie Wayne and Isaac Wood, they added their then-seventh member, guitarist Luke Mark, in 2019.', array[]::text[], 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Country%2C_New_Road'),
