  ('32bae2ae-e7d1-4136-9320-8e1567b9b700', 'en', 'Stevie Wonder', 'american musician (born 1950)', 'Stevland Hardaway Morris, known professionally as Stevie Wonder, is an American singer-songwriter, musician, and record producer. He is widely regarded as one of the most influential musicians of the 20th century, and is credited as a pioneer and influence by musicians across a range of genres that include R&B, pop, soul, gospel, funk, and jazz.', array[]::text[], 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stevie_Wonder'),
