  ('4d4e7791-2eec-4c9e-ab2a-a6c60ba2a274', 'en', 'Jethro Tull', 'british rock band', 'Jethro Tull are a British rock band formed in Blackpool, Lancashire, in 1967. Emerging from the 1960s British blues scene, the band soon developed a distinctive progressive rock sound, blending hard rock, English folk music and classical music, while undergoing numerous stylistic shifts throughout its history.', array[]::text[], 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jethro_Tull_(band)'),
