  ('743b82a8-137d-41e9-b137-a2d8428a05ae', 'en', 'Gnash', 'american musician and producer', 'Garrett Charles Nash, known by his stage name Gnash, is an American singer, rapper, DJ, and record producer. He released his debut extended play (EP), U, in March 2015, and followed by his second EP, Me, in December of that year.', array[]::text[], 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gnash_(musician)'),
