  ('62045352-13e8-49a4-9b6f-13546b3ee75b', 'en', 'Kottonmouth Kings', 'american hip hop and rap rock group', 'The Kottonmouth Kings are an American hip-hop and rap rock group formed in Placentia, California in 1996 by D-Loc and Saint Dog. The group advocates for legalizing cannabis, and their lyrics contain frequent references to marijuana consumption.', array[]::text[], 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kottonmouth_Kings'),
