  ('620c8aea-6e88-4387-a5b0-5fa61ca07d89', 'en', 'The Fray', 'american rock band', 'The Fray is an American rock band from Denver, Colorado, formed in 2002 by schoolmates Isaac Slade and Joe King. Their debut studio album, How to Save a Life (2005) was released by Epic Records and received quadruple platinum certification by the Recording Industry Association of America (RIAA), as well as platinum certification in Australia, Canada, New Zealand and the United Kingdom.', array[]::text[], 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Fray'),
