  ('2002d684-4fdb-4b23-8579-08265ee96e8e', 'en', 'Nemzzz', 'british rapper (born 2004)', 'Nemiah Emmanuel Simms, known professionally as Nemzzz, is a British rapper who gained recognition in 2021 with the tracks "Elevate" and "2MS". He released his first mixtape Do Not Disturb in 2024, which debuted at number 17 on the UK Albums Chart.', array[]::text[], 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nemzzz'),
